#: index.php:268
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Rufus for Linux is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash "
"drives and disk images, such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"Rufus - это утилита для форматирования и создания загрузочных флешек, карт "
"памяти и т.д."

#: index.php:269
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "Rufus особенно полезен, когда нужно:"

#: index.php:271
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Linux, UEFI, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""
"создать загрузочный USB-диск из загрузочного ISO-образа (Windows, Linux, "
"UEFI и т.д.)"

#: index.php:272
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "работать на системах, где не установлена ОС"

#: index.php:273
msgid ""
"you need to create a disk image that you can boot in QEMU, KVM or Hyper-V"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:274
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "запустить низкоуровневую утилиту"

#: index.php:276
msgid ""
"Rufus for Linux is device-first: pick a real USB drive to format it through "
"pkexec, or pick an image file to create a bootable image without any "
"privileges."
msgstr ""

#: index.php:277
#, fuzzy
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus for Linux provides everything you need!"
msgstr "Несмотря на небольшой размер, Rufus умеет делать всё, что нужно!"

#: index.php:278
msgid "Supported formats and options:"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:280
msgid ""
"File systems: FAT32, ext2/ext3/ext4 (built-in), exFAT and NTFS (via the host "
"mkfs tools)"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:281
msgid ""
"Partition schemes: MBR and GPT, with the 2048 sector alignment of Windows "
"Rufus, or 2272 for old BIOS fixes"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:282
msgid ""
"Bootloader: SYSLINUX v6 BIOS bootloader, installed to the MBR and the FAT32 "
"partition boot record"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:283
msgid "Image containers: raw, fixed VHD (native) and VHDX (via qemu-img)"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:284
msgid ""
"Advanced format options: bad block scan, full format, extended label and "
"icon files, casper persistence, dirty-cow scrub pass"
msgstr ""

#: index.php:285
msgid "Verify written data, and compute SHA-1 or SHA-256 checksums"
msgstr ""

